    {
      "type": "text", "id": "init_text", "x": 75, "y": 155, "width": 470, "height": 35,
      "text": "__init__(sdk: TaoExecutionSDK, poll_interval: int = 30)\nCreates runner. SDK already knows its platform.",
      "originalText": "__init__(sdk: TaoExecutionSDK, poll_interval: int = 30)\nCreates runner. SDK already knows its platform.",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 10022, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 10023,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": "init_box", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "run_box", "x": 65, "y": 210, "width": 490, "height": 300,
      "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 10030, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 10031,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "run_text", "type": "text"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "run_text", "x": 75, "y": 215, "width": 470, "height": 280,
      "text": "run(...) -> dict           THE MAIN METHOD\n\nRequired:\n  network_arch: str              \"cosmos-rl\", \"dino\", ...\n  train_dataset_uri: str         \"aws://bucket/data/subset\"\n\nOptional — Job Config:\n  eval_dataset_uri: str = \"\"     Eval dataset URI\n  base_checkpoint: str = \"\"      Pretrained checkpoint\n  workspace_id: str = None       Workspace (default: SDK)\n  image: str = None              Docker image override\n\nOptional — AutoML Config:\n  automl_settings: dict = None   {algorithm, metric, max_recs}\n  automl_hyperparameters: list   Params to search\n  custom_param_ranges: dict      Range overrides\n\nOptional — State & Control:\n  workspace_path: str = \"./automl_workspace\"\n  spec_overrides: dict = None    Override base specs\n  resume: bool = False           Resume from persisted state\n\nOptional — Callbacks:\n  on_recommendation: callable    Called per new rec\n  on_result: callable            Called per result",
      "originalText": "run(...) -> dict           THE MAIN METHOD\n\nRequired:\n  network_arch: str              \"cosmos-rl\", \"dino\", ...\n  train_dataset_uri: str         \"aws://bucket/data/subset\"\n\nOptional — Job Config:\n  eval_dataset_uri: str = \"\"     Eval dataset URI\n  base_checkpoint: str = \"\"      Pretrained checkpoint\n  workspace_id: str = None       Workspace (default: SDK)\n  image: str = None              Docker image override\n\nOptional — AutoML Config:\n  automl_settings: dict = None   {algorithm, metric, max_recs}\n  automl_hyperparameters: list   Params to search\n  custom_param_ranges: dict      Range overrides\n\nOptional — State & Control:\n  workspace_path: str = \"./automl_workspace\"\n  spec_overrides: dict = None    Override base specs\n  resume: bool = False           Resume from persisted state\n\nOptional — Callbacks:\n  on_recommendation: callable    Called per new rec\n  on_result: callable            Called per result",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 10032, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 10033,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": "run_box", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "returns_box", "x": 65, "y": 525, "width": 490, "height": 115,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 10040, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 10041,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "returns_text", "type": "text"}],
