      "text": "Runner owns:\n\n  HPO loop\n  Spec merging\n  Network-specific fixes\n  Metric extraction\n  Log caching\n  State persistence",
      "originalText": "Runner owns:\n\n  HPO loop\n  Spec merging\n  Network-specific fixes\n  Metric extraction\n  Log caching\n  State persistence",
