    {
      "type": "text", "id": "hidden_text", "x": 625, "y": 585, "width": 410, "height": 210,
      "text": "AutoML class          Creates brain + controller + state\nAutoMLContext          Session ID, network, metric\nStateStore            JSON files + fcntl.flock\nController            next_recommendation(), report_result()\nBayesian / Hyperband  GP fit, EI optimization, brackets\nRecommendation        id, specs, status, result, job_id\nAlgorithmParams       20+ algorithm-specific settings\nBrainFactory          Picks the right algorithm class\nSearchSpace           Schema -> searchable params list\n\nspec fixes:           cosmos-rl batch/model_max_length/etc\nlog caching:          Reads logs during polling, not just after\nmetric extraction:    4 regex patterns for different log formats\nmerge_specs:          Deep-merges dotted keys into nested dict\nExecution status:     Checks for PASS/FAIL in logs",
      "originalText": "AutoML class          Creates brain + controller + state\nAutoMLContext          Session ID, network, metric\nStateStore            JSON files + fcntl.flock\nController            next_recommendation(), report_result()\nBayesian / Hyperband  GP fit, EI optimization, brackets\nRecommendation        id, specs, status, result, job_id\nAlgorithmParams       20+ algorithm-specific settings\nBrainFactory          Picks the right algorithm class\nSearchSpace           Schema -> searchable params list\n\nspec fixes:           cosmos-rl batch/model_max_length/etc\nlog caching:          Reads logs during polling, not just after\nmetric extraction:    4 regex patterns for different log formats\nmerge_specs:          Deep-merges dotted keys into nested dict\nExecution status:     Checks for PASS/FAIL in logs",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 30022, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30023,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
